+# pryx external sandboxes
+
+Prepare `pryx template create sandbox-agent` on your fleet. Import `pryxSandboxProvider` from
+`agentos-sandbox/pryx`, passing a configured pryx client and a durable creation key/template.
+Use its result in the existing external sandbox mount provider option. Disposal destroys the
+sandbox. This integrates the public process/filesystem boundary; it does not replace the VM.
+
+The service must reach pryx's private control ingress. Keep its project key in the service
+environment, not VM state. This adapter delegates the current sandbox-agent deploy target and
+the existing AgentOS sandboxAgentProvider bridge rather than inventing another mount API.
